# Managed Standards Rules

Do not edit managed standards inside project repositories unless explicitly asked.

Managed locations commonly include:

- docs/standards/
- .cursor/rules/ when synced from standards package

Organization and Astro starter baseline rules belong in `docs/standards/astro/` (and matching Cursor rules). Do not invent a parallel override file to restate the baseline.

For true project-specific exceptions that diverge from managed standards, use:

- docs/standards-overrides/PROJECT-OVERRIDES.md

Overrides must name an owner, reason, Feature ID when applicable, and review date.

If standards need improvement, propose changes in the central standards package and version them.
